    "requires_controller_reconcile": false,
    "reason": "`chant lifecycle snapshot` calls `describeResources()` on each declared entity and records the result. For Kubernetes objects, this requires only that they exist and are GET-able through the k8s API—CAPI/CAPA never need to have actually provisioned infrastructure for resources to be recorded as `PRESENT`."
  },
