    "specific_to_k8s_lexicon": true,
    "reason": "The Kubernetes lexicon's `describeResources()` records only identity-depth attributes (namespace, labels, resourceVersion, conditions) with no reference-catalog enrichment, so `--at latest` k8s graphs yield zero edges. The AWS lexicon has enrichment for `{Ref}`/`{Fn::GetAtt}` resolution. Declared graphs (offline, no `--at`) are unaffected and resolve edges for all lexicons."
